  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sub Dialogue 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Great! Now that you know how to get around, we can start building machinery.
  - The bottom of the screen contains the build menu. Each button in the menu corresponds
    to a piece of machinery that can be place in the factory. Clicking a button selects
    that piece of machinery.
  - You can place your selected building by clicking with your left mouse button.
    You can also rotate your selected building before placing it with the R button.
    If you ever misplace a building, you can remove it with the right mouse button!
  - Go on and select the NETWORK FACTORY in the build menu and place it in the factory.
    Remember to keep enough space for conveyor belts to be placed later down the
    line!
